.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt AETERNUM_LIVE 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm aeternum_live
.Nd rc.d script for the Aeternum live session
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
script runs at boot of the live image, before
.Xr lightdm 1 .
It mounts a
.Xr tmpfs 5
file system on
.Pa /home/admin ,
keeps the existing contents of the home directory, adds the files from
.Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum/skel ,
and sets the owner to
.Li admin .
Changes made in the live session are kept in memory and are lost at shutdown.
.Pp
The script is removed by
.Xr aeternum-installer 8
from the installed system.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/rc.d/aeternum_live
The script.
.It Pa /usr/local/share/aeternum/skel
Files copied to the home directory of
.Li admin .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rc 8 ,
.Xr aeternum 7
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Zef Lleshaj
